{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月18日 16:32 星期三</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月18日 16:52 星期三</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>日本首相高市早苗今天（18日）下午飛抵深圳機場，出席亞太經合組織（APEC）第三十三次領導人非正式會議。日本TBS電視台報道稱，中方在機場歡迎高市的儀式規模不及參會的其他國家領導人。</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:24:22.928975+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:32:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:31.748921+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:17:22.432037+00:00","content_hash":"411e21f9f2433843de24be8b033f652ac9c690307f223f0896a2203bfb870865","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}